{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridaadventuresandrentals/items/525862/", "pk": 525862, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridaadventuresandrentals/", "pk": 13096, "shortname": "floridaadventuresandrentals", "name": "Florida Adventures and Rentals", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "2 Hour Private Tour", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 8, "unicode": "2 Hour Private Tour", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 11043, "description": "#This is a 2 Hour Private Boat Tour of the 10,000 Islands\n\n##Duration\n\n2 Hours\n\n## About\nIndulge in the ultimate luxury with our private boat tours, where every aspect of your experience is tailored to your desires, designed for unforgettable fun with friends or special celebrations! Cruise the waterways, spy on stunning homes, and jam out to your favorite tunes while soaking up the sun. With options to explore hidden islands, sip cool drinks, and dance to the beat, our private tours promise an exhilarating ride that's totally tailored to your crew's vibe. Get ready to make memories that will last a lifetime!\nThis is fully customizable for a great day on the water for you and your party. We can accommodate parties up to 17 individuals.\n\n##Capacity\n\nOur Boats can accommodate groups of up to 6, 12, or 17 people, providing flexibility to cater to different group sizes and ensure everyone can enjoy the experience together. With three boats in our fleet, we can accommodate a total of 51 guests, ensuring that everyone in your group can join in on the adventure. Whether you're a small intimate gathering or a larger celebration, our diverse fleet and spacious boats guarantee a memorable experience for all.\n\n##What Sets Us Apart\n\n**Personalized Experience:**  We tailor every aspect of your tour to your preferences, ensuring a unique and unforgettable experience.\n**Expert Guidance:** Our experienced guides and captains are knowledgeable about the area and will enhance your journey with their insights and stories.\n**Flexibility:** We offer flexible scheduling and customizable itineraries, allowing you to design the perfect outing for your group.\n**Luxury Amenities:** Enjoy the ultimate in comfort and convenience with amenities such as onboard drinks, music, and optional stops at hidden islands.\n**Special Celebrations:** Whether it's an anniversary, birthday, or other special occasion, our private tours provide the ideal setting for celebration and making memories.\n**Capacity:** Accommodating parties of up to 17 individuals, our tours are perfect for groups of friends, families, or corporate outings.\n**Unmatched Service:** From start to finish, our team is dedicated to providing exceptional service and ensuring your satisfaction throughout your journey.\n\n##What Awaits For You\n\n**A Welcoming Host:** one of our crew members will be ready to assist upon your arrival and assist you with parking.\n**Parking Fee:** please note a $10 parking fee, payable by credit card (Collier County beach permit holders exempt).\n**Restroom facilities:** restrooms are available on-site for your convenience.\n**Easy Boarding:** boarding our Carolina Skiff Boats is easy from the docks.\n**Easy on and off on the islands:** disembarking on the islands after your cruise is hassle-free with our provided 2-step stool, ensuring a dry exit.\"\n\n## Departure Location\n\nWe depart from the **Goodland Boat Park located at 750 Palm Point Dr, Goodland, FL 34140.** This location includes a 5.22 acre park, restrooms, concessions for sale from sunscreen to food and allows easy access to the Ten Thousand Islands and Gulf of Mexico.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Goodland Boat Park", "booking_notes": "![Thank you for booking](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6HeSiQ6XQ2SGZN4lGJ7I)\n[![CLICK HERE FOR DIRECTIONS](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/ggr7BmDWRneMAwYCoEPO)](https://www.google.com/maps/dir/25.955731,-81.7238755/GOODLAND+BOATING+PARK/@25.9391063,-81.7682825,12z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m9!4m8!1m1!4e1!1m5!1m1!1s0x88daf10a7e5f5a7b:0xd9efbd83fb662eaa!2m2!1d-81.6464898!2d25.9217576?entry=ttu)", "cancellation_notes": "Customers will receive a full refund if they cancel their reservation 48 hours prior to the date and time of their booking, (customers will be charged in full within the 48 hour period before the booking). Changes on your reservation will be received 48 hours in advance, otherwise your will be charged in full for your original booking. Contact us by phone to cancel or inquire about a cancellation. No-shows will be charged the full price. Customers will also receive a full refund in case of operator cancellation due to weather or other unforeseen circumstances.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 30, "headline": "Boat Tours for up to 6, 12 or 17 People", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/floridaadventuresandrentals/items/525862/images/1139728/", "pk": 1139728, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/COMQwkvRkaN3KKjzuhi